# Placeholder secrets for the sample fixture's dev env.
# REAL projects MUST gitignore <env>.env files — these committed
# values exist only so docker compose has substitutions to plug in
# when exercising this fixture under tests.
#
# Engine-managed env vars are NOT declared here: POSTGRES_PASSWORD is
# `kind: minted` (docex mints it into infra/tte/dev.env) and
# POSTGRES_USER is `kind: fixed` (inlined at compile). Listing either
# here would collide with the TTE store during aggregation.
